      "title": "Garage Progress Bar",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "1.2.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.0",
        "fileName": "GarageProgressBar-Bundle_1.2.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-18T16:45:55.827Z",
        "changeLog": "New \"Scale\" setting (Default / Large). Choose Large to render the bar wider with bigger text and icons — easier to read at a glance. Default keeps the current size.\nMoved to Aslain's ModsSettingsAPI and now bundles the ModsList API dependency.\nLarger, clearer tooltips — description text and icons are bigger and more legible."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.3.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.1.0",
        "fileName": "GarageProgressBar-Bundle_1.3.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-19T12:17:30.118Z",
        "changeLog": "New \"Progress Mode\" setting. Choose how the XP readout is shown: Current (just your accumulated XP) or Current / Required (your XP against what the next step needs), per bar mode. Configure it in the mod's settings panel.\nNew \"Show Progress %\" toggle. Optionally prepend the completion percentage (capped at 100%) to the left of the readout, so you can see at a glance how close the current step is."
      }
    },
